title: "What happens when yy yanks a line?"
accTitle: "Yank flash sequence"
accDescr: "CodeMirror Vim selects the line, the yank operator pushes text, the Bob plugin paints those live ranges, and a generation-guarded 200 millisecond timer clears the overlay."
config:
  flowchart:
